1. PROJECT OVERVIEW 
1.1 Project Introduction 
The objective of this project is to develop a professional B2B Bulk T-Shirt Ordering and 
Customization Website. 
The platform will allow customers to explore diAerent T-shirt collections, configure bulk 
order requirements, upload custom designs and submit quotation requests. 
Unlike traditional e-commerce websites, this platform will not support individual T-shirt 
purchases. 
The primary business model is based on bulk orders, customized apparel requirements 
and quotation-based order confirmation. 
1.2 Project Objectives 
1. Develop a premium online presence for the T-shirt business. 
2. Showcase all available T-shirt collections. 
3. Allow customers to configure bulk orders. 
4. Support multiple sizes, colours and quantities. 
5. Allow customers to upload logos and custom designs. 
6. Generate bulk order enquiries. 
7. Provide an admin dashboard for enquiry management. 
8. Allow administrators to prepare and send quotations. 
9. Manage confirmed orders and production status. 
10. Generate more B2B business enquiries. 
