4. SMART BULK ORDER BUILDER 
This is the core feature of the entire platform. 
The system must allow customers to configure their T-shirt requirements before 
submitting a quotation request. 
4.1 Product Selection 
Customer selects a T-shirt from the product catalogue. 
The selected product information must be displayed in the bulk order configuration 
screen. 
4.2 Colour Selection 
 Display available colours. 
 Customer can select one or multiple colours. 
 Show colour names and visual colour indicators. 
 Only admin-configured colours must be available. 
4.3 Size Selection & Quantity Management 
Customer must be able to specify quantities for each size. 
Example: 
Size Quantity 
S 
20 
M 50 
L 
75 
XL 40 
XXL 15 
Total 200 
The system must automatically calculate the total quantity. 
Validation Rules 
 Quantity cannot be negative. 
 Quantity must be a whole number. 
 At least one size must have a quantity greater than zero. 
 Total quantity must satisfy the configured minimum order quantity. 
 Quantity changes must automatically update the total. 
The system must support multiple colour-wise size distributions. 
Example: 100 Black + 100 White, each with separate size quantities. 
4.4 Customization Selection 
