14. BUSINESS RULES 
The following rules must be implemented. 
1. The platform is exclusively designed for bulk orders. 
2. Individual piece purchases must not be supported. 
3. Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ) must be configurable by product. 
4. Admin must be able to configure diAerent MOQs for diAerent products. 
5. A bulk enquiry may contain multiple products. 
6. Each product may contain multiple colours. 
7. Each colour may contain multiple size-wise quantities. 
8. Total quantity must be calculated automatically. 
9. Customers must be able to upload custom designs. 
10. All enquiries must generate unique enquiry IDs. 
11. Quotations must be generated by authorized admin users. 
12. Quotation prices must be configurable and editable. 
13. Customers must receive enquiry confirmation. 
14. Only approved quotations can be converted into confirmed orders. 
15. Manufacturing status must be updated by authorized staA. 
16. All important enquiry, quotation and order status changes must be recorded. 
17. No order should enter production without the required confirmation. 
