18. FINAL PROJECT REQUIREMENT 
The final application must operate as a professional B2B Bulk T-Shirt Ordering & 
Customization Platform. 
The website should not behave like a conventional retail shopping website. 
Its primary objective is to convert website visitors into qualified bulk-order enquiries 
and help the business manage those enquiries from initial contact to quotation, order 
confirmation, production and delivery. 
Core Business Workflow: 
Customer Visits Website → Explores Products → Configures Bulk Order → Uploads 
Design → Submits Enquiry → Admin Reviews → Quotation Generated → Customer 
Approves → Order Confirmed → Production → Quality Check → Dispatch → Delivery. 
FINAL DEVELOPMENT GOAL: 
Build a scalable, professional and user-friendly bulk apparel ordering platform that 
simplifies the entire bulk T-shirt enquiry and order management process. 
